          "id": "readme--about-me",
          "title": "👨‍💻 About Me",
          "kind": "about",
          "html": "<h2 id=\"readme--about-me\">👨‍💻 About Me</h2>\n<p>I am a <strong>Computer Science Student</strong> at <strong>SGTU</strong> (Batch of 2028) with a passion for digital awareness and innovation. I bridge the gap between complex data systems and intuitive user interfaces.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>🔭 I’m currently working on <strong>Data Engineering Pipelines &amp; Full Stack Web Apps</strong>.</li>\n<li>🌱 I’m currently learning <strong>Advanced Neural Networks &amp; System Design</strong>.</li>\n<li>👯 I’m looking to collaborate on <strong>Open Source AI Projects</strong>.</li>\n<li>💬 Ask me about <strong>React, Python, Data Analysis, and UI/UX</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />"
        },
        {
          "id": "readme--tech-stack",
