git&amp;logoColor=white\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" />\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/VS_Code-007ACC?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=visual-studio-code&amp;logoColor=white\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n</div>\n\n<hr />"
