          "id": "readme--how-this-portfolio-updates-itself",
          "title": "⚙️ How this portfolio updates itself",
          "kind": "other",
          "html": "<h2 id=\"readme--how-this-portfolio-updates-itself\">⚙️ How this portfolio updates itself</h2>\n<p>Projects, project pages, GitHub stats and verified milestones are synced automatically from my public\nGitHub repositories by a GitHub Actions workflow (hourly, plus on demand), then redeployed to GitHub Pages.\nMake a repository public and it shows up here on its own. Setup, configuration and troubleshooting:\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Soham-o/Portfolio/blob/main/docs/AUTOMATION.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">docs/AUTOMATION.md</a>.</p>"
